# /function og:place (ops, on Anarchy): put the [OG] Merchant in the market, opposite the Ripperdoc. Tagged crispy_shop
# (or the market moves it out) and needtag.og (the chat-tags mod only lets players wearing [OG] trade). The market's
# own spawn_shops/reinstall kills crispy_shop villagers, so run this again after one.
execute in crispy:market run forceload add -64 56 -40 80
execute in crispy:market run kill @e[type=minecraft:villager,tag=crispy_ogshop]
